==Trivia==
*[[Mini White Cyclone]] is directly related to White Cyclone, but the relation changes depending on the language, being White Cyclone's little brother in English and its second son in Japanese.
*White Cyclone is usually treated as the third [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]], coming after [[Dark Cyclone]], yet in the [[Enemy Release Order]] it is the second.
*White Cyclone has the shortest range of all [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemies]] and the second-highest DPS of all Cyclones and Floating enemies, with [[Red Cyclone]] in first place.
*Ironically, White Cyclone has lower range than Mini White Cyclone.
*White Cyclone is the first full-sized Cyclone to appear in the main [[Legend Stages]].
*Prior to [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]], White Cyclone was a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/Floating enemy.

